%%body
{
  Abyssal Iron, while a useful material, had proven a little too much of a time sink to ever dream of scaling.

  On the other hand, Steel, a mixture of Iron and Carbon would certainly prove useful.

    @ Nori "Indeed, Steel would be useful, but-"

  You eyed the failures in your blast furnace and what was the murky swirls of your would-be steel.

    @ Nori "It appears this too has been cursed."

  Story of your life at this point, the world certainly knew how to test your patience, but that aside, so far you had been to three domains total: Harmonia, Kamda and Derelik.

  Coal was readily available in Harmonia, as was Iron, but for some reason, the process of making steel was cursed, what other entity needed to be dealt with to obtain the coveted material!?

    @ Nori "Good news, or... bad news depending on how you look at it, I've picked up trail."

  A trail is good, even if it was dangerous.

}
%date 2026-07-31, 2026-08-04
